  "description": "Jin-Yul is the Jade Emperor’s exclusive hair designer in the heavenly realm, envied by all immortals as a god of beauty who leads fashion and trends. However, due to an arrogant, alcohol-induced mistake on an important day, he accidentally shaves off the Jade Emperor’s crown! Banished to the human world (the Murim) as punishment, Jin-Yul loses his divine powers. To regain his strength and return to the heavens, he decides to open a hair salon in the martial arts world, using his legendary grooming skills to survive and fight his way back to the top.",
